# Supplied asset packs. Source material for scripts/bake-camp-props.mjs, not
# a deliverable: 5.1MB of which about a tenth is used, and the licence is
# unresolved (see docs/camp-assets.md). The baked output is committed; the
# packs are not redistributed from here.
assets/camp-source/

# The supplied horse, at 1.08 MB. The baked 314 kB version is what ships and
# is committed; the source stays out for the same reason the camp packs do.
# Provenance and licence status: docs/landing-assets.md.
assets/horse-source/
# Rendered frames from scripts/visual-baseline.mjs. The script is the
# baseline; the PNGs are 20MB a run and regenerate in three minutes.
# Globbed, because comparing two passes means two output directories.
.visual*/
